      "description": "Toolbar tab switcher; a white thumb slides under the selection on the spring.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\" role=\"tablist\"><span class=\"ds-seg-thumb\"></span><button class=\"ds-seg-item\" aria-selected=\"true\">Relay</button><button class=\"ds-seg-item\">Desktop App</button><button class=\"ds-seg-item\">Settings</button></div>",
